    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your guns, and spread some lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Country is a roguelike shooter set in the Wild West. Shoot your way through waves of outlaws who have taken over the countryside, and defeat their leader. Build your arsenal as you find more ammo and dynamite.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to clear the land of no-good scoundrels?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot TNT barrels\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/a7f2ffe5ef3752f542faf389a4dc46b5.poster.avif?t=1754444684\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/a7f2ffe5ef3752f542faf389a4dc46b5.webm?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/a7f2ffe5ef3752f542faf389a4dc46b5.mp4?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast the outlaws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/5d1772888e340e4a8c43b3bd7bf5f6ec.poster.avif?t=1754444684\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/5d1772888e340e4a8c43b3bd7bf5f6ec.webm?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/5d1772888e340e4a8c43b3bd7bf5f6ec.mp4?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get surrounded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/dfda9f684a944c78ca100cc7a48ea33c.poster.avif?t=1754444684\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/dfda9f684a944c78ca100cc7a48ea33c.webm?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655790/extras/dfda9f684a944c78ca100cc7a48ea33c.mp4?t=1754444684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels, enemies, and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that can hear you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible fences, crates, and barrels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, Hard, and Nightmare</p></li></ul>",
